WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sara (Acme Remit): Thanks for joining. We're an exchange house with about 40 corridors.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Sara (Acme Remit): Our biggest pain is card fees on top-ups, and manual reconciliation every morning.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Omar: For this we'd suggest the Link SDK, so you get Lean's screens out of the box.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Sara (Acme Remit): We want SIP for one-off top-ups first, and Account on File for repeat customers.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Sara (Acme Remit): Payouts to UAE accounts would come later. Can we verify the account before paying out?

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Omar: Yes, account verification is available. Old records are discarded after a year.

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Sara (Acme Remit): We're aiming to go live in Q1, ideally by end of February. Pricing TBC.
